            Synthesis of 8 standard equity valuation frameworks comparing model intrinsic targets against current market price.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Consensus Target Callout -->
        <div class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-3">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400 uppercase">Consensus Fair Value</div>
            <div class="text-base font-bold font-mono text-white">{consensusFairValue !== null ? `$${consensusFairValue.toFixed(2)}` : 'N/A'}</div>
          </div>
          <div class={`text-right font-mono font-bold text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded ${isConsensusPositive ? 'bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-800/60' : 'bg-rose-950 text-rose-400 border border-rose-800/60'}`}>
